                            Jamaica-row, Bermondsey / Mr William Raddon 22 Upper Eaton-st Pimlico.
                            This last was the line engraver artist and entomologist William Raddon
                            1778-1848, friend of Fuseli. Married to Ann, 22 years his senior. </p> <p>It seems an unlikely pattern of visits for a glazier.</p>
